WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.172 --> 00:00:04.639
Being active doesn’t have to mean
pumping iron five days a week.

00:00:04.664 --> 00:00:06.273
But that’s cool if you want to!

00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:10.177
For everyone else, the opportunity
to be active is all around.

00:00:10.202 --> 00:00:12.813
In fact, you’re probably
more active than you think.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.219
Yes, you!

00:00:14.609 --> 00:00:16.149
With Manulife Vitality,

00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:18.389
you could be earning
rewards by tracking simple,

00:00:18.414 --> 00:00:22.627
everyday activities like regular
visits to the doctor and dentist,

00:00:22.652 --> 00:00:24.269
taking the stairs

00:00:24.294 --> 00:00:27.895
or hopping off the subway two stops
early to squeeze in a few more steps.

00:00:28.065 --> 00:00:30.255
Fitting the little things
in is all it takes.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.699
And since every little
move you make adds up,

00:00:32.724 --> 00:00:34.735
why not keep score and
get rewarded for it?

00:00:35.169 --> 00:00:40.173
Manulife Vitality empowers you to take
charge of your health, little by little.

00:00:40.198 --> 00:00:42.109
And we’re with you
every step of the way.

00:00:42.446 --> 00:00:48.148
Find out how to start tracking and
earning today at Manulife.ca/Vitality

